  "title": "Alaska Air Group announces webcast of second-quarter 2024 financial results",
  "summary": "SEATTLE — Alaska Air Group Inc., the parent company of Alaska Airlines Inc. and Horizon Air Industries Inc., will hold its quarterly conference call to discuss 2024 second quarter financial results at 11:30 a.m. EDT/ 8:30 a.m. PDT, Thursday, July 18, 2024. A webcast of the call will be available to the public at www.alaskaair.com/investors.…",
